{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/bc1ed3e6fc0d006c59dffaf3a8c69ea9.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, notes fall down in sync with the music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must press the correct key at the right time, when the note reaches the judgment line, to process it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/c361bf6e8c11b17258ce5b9738adc418.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two types of notes: White notes and yellow notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/90d5ef2bc9c58272221eb70eb567f292.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To process a yellow note, you should press a key in the Q row of the keyboard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to process a white note, you should press a key in the A row of the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/db3c727408f5ac58cd19aa6dc17cf096.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more accurate your timing is when you press the key, the better your judgment will be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gain or lose life depending on this judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/5327e4a25f103e8e1382b1a35ec5cef0.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the timing is correct but the keyboard row does not match the note color, an OFF judgment will be given. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lose less life than a MISS, but be careful as it breaks your combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/3a5cab75442fd53b9204738e014cf088.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long notes refer to notes with a tail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You process them by holding down the key for the entire length of the tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/3d444a0119b63db31a4aed4a6cec0b2e.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you finish the song with some life remaining, it will count as cleared. Pay attention to your life and try to complete each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880410?t=1757779784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/1957ef3288af927261857dfa657b83bbf1ed1387/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757779784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/11e79760563fca2a214a63948d1b39c1f01724c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757779784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/11e79760563fca2a214a63948d1b39c1f01724c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757779784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/bc1ed3e6fc0d006c59dffaf3a8c69ea9.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, notes fall down in sync with the music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must press the correct key at the right time, when the note reaches the judgment line, to process it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/c361bf6e8c11b17258ce5b9738adc418.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two types of notes: White notes and yellow notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/90d5ef2bc9c58272221eb70eb567f292.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To process a yellow note, you should press a key in the Q row of the keyboard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to process a white note, you should press a key in the A row of the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/db3c727408f5ac58cd19aa6dc17cf096.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more accurate your timing is when you press the key, the better your judgment will be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gain or lose life depending on this judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/5327e4a25f103e8e1382b1a35ec5cef0.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the timing is correct but the keyboard row does not match the note color, an OFF judgment will be given. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lose less life than a MISS, but be careful as it breaks your combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/3a5cab75442fd53b9204738e014cf088.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long notes refer to notes with a tail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You process them by holding down the key for the entire length of the tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/extras/3d444a0119b63db31a4aed4a6cec0b2e.avif?t=1757779784\" width=798 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you finish the song with some life remaining, it will count as cleared. Pay attention to your life and try to complete each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Team Charlotte"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880410/bb72a0be7d55d44e173710a55b7921d7f45e2f9d/header.jpg?t=1757779784","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187871,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187871/movie480.mp4?t=1757779772","max":"ht